arker\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">を</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"みつめ\" data-defn=\"to stare at/to gaze at/to look hard at/to watch intently/to fix one&#x27;s eyes on (見つめる)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">見つめ</span><rt>みつめ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ました\" data-defn=\"verb polite suffix (past: did / -ed)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">ました</span><rt></rt></ruby>。",
