      "duration": 5.67
    },
    {
      "id": "story_2508_p0_c1",
      "chunk_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "text": "おじいさんはその子供がとても愛らしいと思い、捕まえた魚を全部あげると言いました。",
      "text_en": "The old man thought the child was adorable and offered to give him all the fish he had caught.",
